# Pad regression with the default keyboard bindings, at the iPad 2420x1668
# drawable (guest frame 1568x1080). Use an isolated profile.
# Triangle confirms, dpad navigates, cross accelerates, square brakes,
# left stick steers and Start pauses/backs out of the touch-opened Quit dialog.
# Inspect the dumped frames; successful script delivery alone is not proof
# that the intended menu/race was reached.
wait 20000
dump intro
pad triangle down
wait 200
pad triangle up
wait 12000
dump title
pad triangle down
wait 200
pad triangle up
wait 8000
dump alias-question
pad triangle down
wait 200
pad triangle up
wait 8000
dump main-menu
tap 200 1020
wait 2000
peek 0x00987f50 32
dump touch-quit
pad start down
wait 200
pad start up
wait 2000
dump pad-back
pad right down
wait 200
pad right up
wait 2000
dump menu-right-1
pad right down
wait 200
pad right up
wait 2000
dump menu-right-2
pad triangle down
wait 200
pad triangle up
wait 5000
dump quick-race
pad triangle down
wait 200
pad triangle up
wait 5000
dump race-mode
pad triangle down
wait 200
pad triangle up
wait 5000
dump track-select
pad triangle down
wait 200
pad triangle up
wait 5000
dump next-1
pad triangle down
wait 200
pad triangle up
wait 5000
dump next-2
pad triangle down
wait 200
pad triangle up
wait 30000
dump loading
wait 30000
dump race-1
wait 20000
dump race-2
pad cross down
wait 6000
dump accelerate
pad left_x -24000
wait 600
dump steer-left
pad left_x 0
wait 600
pad left_x 24000
wait 600
dump steer-right
pad left_x 0
pad cross up
pad square down
wait 1600
dump brake
pad square up
pad start down
wait 200
pad start up
wait 2000
dump pause
quit
